# Cristae Lab runs fully offline. No environment variables are required for
# the simulator, patient profiles, diagnosis, dashboard, timeline, therapy
# pages or CSV exports. Scenarios, visits and the run log live in your
# browser's local storage (IndexedDB / localStorage).
#
# The values below are ONLY needed if you want the optional AI interpretation
# buttons, which call a hosted AI service over the internet. Without them
# those buttons show an error and everything else works.

# Hosted AI gateway key (server-side only, never shipped to the browser).
# Managed automatically when running inside Lovable; for a local offline
# setup you can leave this unset.
# LOVABLE_API_KEY=

